Your list can hold more than one place per timezone — Tampa and New York can both be on it. A city and its timezone are now separate entries, and a city says where it is: Nelson, BC. Ports of call appear on the map with arrival times; tap one for the cruise that calls there, or keep it as a clock. The map glides to whatever you pick instead of jumping. Widgets no longer repeat a clock, and tell two places of one name apart. Lighter map highlights, and better time sync.
